<div class="main" data-type-id="<%= typeof typeId !== 'undefined' ? typeId : '' %>" data-topic-id="<%= topicId %>">
  <br><br>
  <form id="office-topic-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();">
    <table class="add-topic-form text-center bg-light table table-sm" width="95%">
      <tr height="40" class="align-middle">
        <td width="85%" class="text-center">
          <span class="text-warning"><b>Edit Topic Form</b></span>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><br>
          <table class="topic-detail text-center table table-sm" width="95%">
            <tr height="25" class="align-middle">
              <td width="17.5%" class="text-end">
                <span class="text-dark"><b>Topic Name</b></span>
              </td>
              <td width="2.5%" class="text-center">
                <span class="text-dark"><b>:</b></span>
              </td>
              <td width="80%" class="text-start">
                <input type="text" name="topic_name" size="90" value="" required>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr id="office-topic-headline-form-row" height="25" class="align-middle">
              <td width="17.5%" class="text-end">
                <span class="text-dark"><b>Topic Headline</b></span>
              </td>
              <td width="2.5%" class="text-center">
                <span class="text-dark"><b>:</b></span>
              </td>
              <td width="80%" class="text-start">
                <textarea name="topic_headline" cols="88" rows="1" required></textarea>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td width="17.5%" class="text-end">
                <span class="text-dark"><b>Topic Detail</b></span>
              </td>
              <td width="2.5%" class="text-center">
                <span class="text-dark"><b>:</b></span>
              </td>
              <td width="80%" class="text-start"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td width="17.5%" class="text-start"></td>
              <td width="2.5%" class="text-start"></td>
              <td width="80%" class="text-start">
                <span class="text-danger"><i><u>หมายเหตุ</u></i></span><br>
                <span class="text-primary">
                  1. บทเรียนหรือเนื้อหาที่จะใส่ต้องอยู่ในรูปแบบของไฟล์ .word<br>
                  2. รูปภาพหรือไฟล์เสียงที่จะใส่ควรเป็นชื่อภาษาอังกฤษ
                </span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-light">
              <td colspan="3" width="90%">
                <textarea id="topic_detail" name="topic_detail" class="form-control" placeholder="" rows="20"></textarea>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr height="25" class="align-middle">
              <td colspan="3"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr height="25" class="align-middle">
              <td width="80%" colspan="3" class="text-center">
                <input title="Edit Topic" type="submit" value="Edit Topic">
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr height="25" class="align-middle">
              <td width="80%" colspan="3" class="text-center">
                <span class="text-danger"><b><span id="office-topic-form-message"></span></b></span>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <br>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </form>
  <br>
  <div class="text-center">
    <a id="office-topic-back-link" href="#">
      <span><b>&lt;&lt; Back to Topic List</b></span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <br><br>
</div>